            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kokaru lokakwat akanykape loka aiiar naka Noa, toma olap lokiareit, kapaaran nakitomonet kakanykaarei naka elap, kapaaran kaŋin kocilunos akonyen nuka ataroi nukapolok, konaaros apedon nuka akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotep akiru akwap apaarasia akaisaoŋon paaran ka kuare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapaaran kaŋin kolomasi Noa, ka Sem, ka Kam ka Yapet, odwe luka Noa, ka aberu naka Noa, ka aŋor auni nuka odweke nepepe kakes, toma ataker; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kes, ka ŋolitian koponeke, ka ibaren kere kotoma oponekec, ka niniborc kere yeneliat kokwap toma oponeke, ka ninibore yeneporitoi toma oponeke, ka ŋinikweny yenikejaas abebenoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolomasi neejai Noa toma ataker, ninikuan kere naajai eiyeŋane loka aijar iareiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
